{"id":"02_cote","scene":"map","text":"Sur la côte, le port de Ouidah s'ouvrait sur l'océan. Depuis des siècles, des navires venaient jusque-là. Le royaume avait aussi sa part d'ombre : il avait lui-même pris part à la traite. Une vérité qu'il ne faut jamais taire.","file":"assets/audio/narration/02_cote.mp3","dur":18.015,"words":[{"w":"Sur","t0":0,"t1":0.232},{"w":"la","t0":0.279,"t1":0.372},{"w":"côte,","t0":0.453,"t1":0.836},{"w":"le","t0":0.917,"t1":1.022},{"w":"port","t0":1.091,"t1":1.335},{"w":"de","t0":1.358,"t1":1.474},{"w":"Ouidah","t0":1.567,"t1":2.125},{"w":"s'ouvrait","t0":2.229,"t1":2.775},{"w":"sur","t0":2.833,"t1":2.972},{"w":"l'océan.","t0":3.019,"t1":3.622},{"w":"Depuis","t0":4.342,"t1":4.83},{"w":"des","t0":4.876,"t1":5.004},{"w":"siècles,","t0":5.027,"t1":5.735},{"w":"des","t0":6.084,"t1":6.177},{"w":"navires","t0":6.211,"t1":6.711},{"w":"venaient","t0":6.745,"t1":7.187},{"w":"jusque-là.","t0":7.256,"t1":8.022},{"w":"Le","t0":8.731,"t1":8.916},{"w":"royaume","t0":8.986,"t1":9.416},{"w":"avait","t0":9.439,"t1":9.636},{"w":"aussi","t0":9.66,"t1":9.938},{"w":"sa","t0":9.985,"t1":10.101},{"w":"part","t0":10.17,"t1":10.368},{"w":"d'ombre","t0":10.391,"t1":10.902},{"w":":","t0":10.983,"t1":11.041},{"w":"il","t0":11.482,"t1":11.598},{"w":"avait","t0":11.691,"t1":11.842},{"w":"lui-même","t0":11.854,"t1":12.318},{"w":"pris","t0":12.341,"t1":12.55},{"w":"part","t0":12.585,"t1":12.934},{"w":"à","t0":12.98,"t1":13.038},{"w":"la","t0":13.119,"t1":13.189},{"w":"traite.","t0":13.259,"t1":13.735},{"w":"Une","t0":14.35,"t1":14.536},{"w":"vérité","t0":14.547,"t1":15.128},{"w":"qu'il","t0":15.256,"t1":15.43},{"w":"ne","t0":15.476,"t1":15.557},{"w":"faut","t0":15.639,"t1":15.79},{"w":"jamais","t0":15.813,"t1":16.15},{"w":"taire.","t0":16.196,"t1":17.415}]}